  "description": "Learn to ride with everyone’s favorite underwater friend, Baby Shark! Designed for children aged 3-5 years or 34-40 inches tall, The 12-inch Baby Shark Bike by Dynacraft features authentic Baby Shark graphics on the frame, training wheels, and a handlebar shield, making it extra fun for your child's first ride. With coaster brakes, the bike provides reliable and secure stops, while the training wheels offer an extra level of comfort and stability as your child learns to ride. The quick-adjust seat allows you to find the perfect fit for your child, which can be adjusted as they grow taller. This 12-inch Baby Shark Bike is sure to create unforgettable memories for your kiddos.",
